      "affected_paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 7,
          "blockIndex": 5,
          "paragraphInBlock": 0,
          "text": "When Newton (牛顿) covered the hole with red glass, he saw only a red patch on the wall.\nWhen he used blue glass, he saw a blue patch, and other coloured pieces of glass could be compared in the same way.",
          "complete_sentence_count": 2
        },
        {
          "index": 8,
          "blockIndex": 5,
          "paragraphInBlock": 1,
          "text": "These observations showed that the old idea that a prism dyes light was mistaken.\nIn this ordinary-glass experiment, the prism separates colours already mixed in the light instead of making new colours (see 彩图 I (Color Plate I)).",
          "complete_sentence_count": 2
        },
        {
          "index": 9,
          "blockIndex": 5,
          "paragraphInBlock": 2,
          "text": "White light is not just one colour, and many different colours can be separated from it.\nWhen these colours enter our eyes together, their combined effect makes us see white light.",
          "complete_sentence_count": 2
        },
        {
          "index": 10,
          "blockIndex": 5,
          "paragraphInBlock": 3,
          "text": "The source then uses another prism turned through $180^\\circ$ relative to the first and, with a suitable arrangement, brings all the beams in the spectrum back together.\nThe result is white light again (see 彩图 II (Color Plate II)), because all the colours have been recombined, not because turning a prism alone always works.",
          "complete_sentence_count": 2
        },
        {
          "index": 11,
          "blockIndex": 5,
          "paragraphInBlock": 4,
          "text": "If sufficiently single-coloured green light is selected and passed through another ordinary glass prism, it remains green rather than changing into another colour through refraction.\nThe condition matters, because a selected green band that still contains nearby colours can have those finer differences separated further.",
          "complete_sentence_count": 2
        }
      ],
